  Title: This new antibody may stop one of the deadliest breast cancers
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260122074030.htm
  category: oncology
  importance: 90
  ai_summary: "A novel antibody shows promise in targeting and destroying chemotherapy-resistant triple-negative breast cancer cells, demonstrating slowed tumor growth and reduced metastasis in early trials."

  Title: A simple blood test mismatch linked to kidney failure and death
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260121034146.htm
  category: nephrology
  importance: 80
  ai_summary: "A study reveals a significant association between discrepancies in creatinine and cystatin C blood tests and an increased risk of kidney failure, heart disease, and mortality."

  Title: This one gene may explain most Alzheimer’s cases
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260122073623.htm
  category: neurology
  importance: 92
  ai_summary: "Research suggests a strong genetic predisposition to Alzheimer's disease, with the APOE gene potentially explaining up to 90% of cases, opening avenues for new therapeutic targets."

  Title: The bottled water everyone trusts may be the riskiest
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260122074031.htm
  category: public health/research
  importance: 75
  ai_summary: "In Guatemala, bottled water from refillable jugs was found to be frequently contaminated, contrasting with the cleaner municipal well water, highlighting potential public health risks."

